I has been decided that the Booking Fee will be introduced and applied in GE market using the following setup:

* Booking Fee will be collected by the Driver from the Passenger and will be included as a separate line in the trip invoice, issued by the Driver;
* No commission will be collected from the Booking Fee by Bolt (i.e. 100% commission free Driver earning);
* Driver will retain the entire amount of Booking Fee collected from Passenger;
* Neither Bolt nor Smartly will receive any revenue from the Booking Fee.

The  Clause 1.2 of current [GE Passenger T&Cs|https://bolt.eu/en/legal/ge/terms-for-riders/] already provides the possibility of charging booking fees. 

No further legal issues were identified to introduce the Booking Fee in GE market under the above setup.

