a) I have used the model t&c of semi-localised market - I am awaiting final confirmation from [~accountid:610279973900e60070a3495c] that Malta is semi-localised and not fully localised;

b) The parking enforcement penalty of 6EUR has been added to the t&c. Hence, once the t&c are published and applicable, the parking enforcement feature should be enabled. It is important to make sure the local city rules are available for Malta and updated. I would like to highlight that the main benefit of the parking enforcement feature according to global experience is the impact on user behaviour, linked to the end of the ride threat that improper parking may lead to penalties. Hence, the parking enforcement penalties are recommended not to be heavily used;

c) we should add the telephone contact once this is clarified as well

Once I have confirmation of point a) and c) I will finalise the t&c and we can proceed for publication. Please let me know if you have any questions.

